","table":"table-1"},"26":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-24","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#各配置项的含义","content":"| 配置项                    | 说明                                  |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` | 你的密钥，以 `Authorization: Bearer` 方式发送 |","table":"table-1"},"27":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-25","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#各配置项的含义","content":"| 配置项                                        | 说明                                                |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC` | 关闭遥测、错误上报等非必要请求。同时会关闭自动更新，需要时手动运行 `claude update` |","table":"table-1"},"28":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-26","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#各配置项的含义","content":"请用 `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`，不要用 `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`。后者在交互模式下需要手动确认一次，拒绝过一次就会被静默忽略。"},"29":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-27","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#启动并验证","content":"在项目目录下运行 `claude`，然后输入 `/status`，确认 **Anthropic base URL** 显示的是 `https://api.muteki.site`，再随便问一句测试即可。"},"30":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-28","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#启动并验证","content":"先确认配置文件路径和 JSON 格式都正确。如果仍然弹出登录引导，编辑 `~/.claude.json`（Windows 为 `%USERPROFILE%\\.claude.json`；注意它在用户目录下，和 `.claude` 文件夹不是同一个东西），在最外层加上："},"31":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-29","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#启动并验证","content":"然后重新启动 `claude`。"},"32":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-30","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#启动并验证","content":"说明之前登录过 claude.ai 账号，和网关密钥冲突了。在 Claude Code 里运行 `/logout` 退出官方账号即可。"},"33":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-31","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#启动并验证","content":"在 `env` 里加一行 `\"CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS\": \"1\"`，关闭实验性功能后重启。"},"34":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-32","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#指定模型可选","content":"默认不需要配置模型，Claude Code 会自动使用 Opus / Sonnet / Haiku。在会话中可以用 `/model` 切换。"},"35":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-33","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#指定模型可选","content":"如果想固定使用某个模型，在 `env` 里加上（模型名以模型广场为准）："},"36":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-34","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#指定模型可选","content":"想按档位分别指定，可以用 `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL`、`ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL`、`ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL`（Haiku 档位也用于后台小任务）。"},"37":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-35","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#指定模型可选","content":"新模型需要较新版本的 Claude Code 才能识别，用不了新模型时先运行 `claude update`。"},"38":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-36","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#vs-code-插件","content":"Claude Code 的 VS Code 插件与终端版共用 `~/.claude/settings.json`，但插件自身的登录检查不读取这个文件。为了避免插件弹出登录，建议在 VS Code 的用户设置（`Ctrl/Cmd + Shift + P` → **Preferences: Open User Settings (JSON)**）中再加上："},"39":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-37","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#vs-code-插件","content":"修改后重新加载 VS Code 窗口。"},"40":{"id":"/docs/agents/claude-code-38","page_id":"/docs/agents/claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/claude-code#使用限制","content":"通过网关使用时，Remote Control、语音输入等依赖 Anthropic 官方账号的功能不可用。"},"41":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","type":"page","content":"Codex",