gents/codex#配置文件位置","content":"如果已经有自己的 Codex 配置，先复制一份备份，再把下面的内容合并进去，不要直接清空。"},"64":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-22","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#方式一修改官方地址推荐","content":"只把 Codex 内置的 OpenAI 服务地址指向网关，改动最少。"},"65":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-23","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#修改-configtoml","content":"把下面三行加到 `config.toml` 的**最开头**："},"66":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-24","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#修改-configtoml","content":"`model` 可以换成模型广场里 OpenAI 分组的其他模型。"},"67":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-25","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#用-api-key-登录","content":"如果之前用 ChatGPT 账号登录过 Codex，先运行 `codex logout` 退出。"},"68":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-26","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#用-api-key-登录","content":"然后运行 `codex`，在登录界面选择 **Provide your own API key**，粘贴你的 `sk-` 密钥。"},"69":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-27","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#用-api-key-登录","content":"也可以直接用命令登录："},"70":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-28","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#验证","content":"运行 `codex`，输入 `/status` 确认当前使用的是 API Key 登录、地址为 `https://api.muteki.site/v1`，再发一句话测试。"},"71":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-29","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#方式二自定义服务商","content":"如果你还想保留官方 ChatGPT 账号登录，或者需要在多个服务之间切换，可以新增一个独立的服务商，用环境变量传递密钥。"},"72":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-30","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#设置环境变量","content":"把下面这行加到 `~/.zshrc` 或 `~/.bashrc` 末尾，然后新开一个终端："},"73":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-31","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#设置环境变量","content":"运行下面的命令写入用户环境变量，然后**新开**一个终端窗口："},"74":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-32","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#设置环境变量","content":"从桌面图标启动的程序可能读不到终端里设置的环境变量（macOS 尤其明显）。在 ChatGPT 桌面客户端里使用 Codex 时，推荐用方式一。"},"75":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-33","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#在-ide-插件中使用","content":"Codex 的 VS Code 等 IDE 插件读取同一个 `config.toml`。按上面任一方式配置好后，在插件的登录界面选择 **Use API Key** 并填入密钥（方式二无需登录），然后重启 IDE。"},"76":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-34","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#注意事项","content":"**顶层配置必须写在最前面**：`model`、`model_provider`、`openai_base_url` 这些配置项必须放在第一个 `[xxx]` 小节之前，否则会被当成那个小节的内容。"},"77":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-35","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#注意事项","content":"**只能写在用户级配置里**：项目目录下的 `.codex/config.toml` 会忽略 `openai_base_url`、`model_provider`、`model_providers` 这些配置。"},"78":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-36","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#注意事项","content":"**`wire_api` 只能是 `responses`**：新版 Codex 已移除 `chat`，填 `chat` 会直接报错。"},"79":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-37","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#注意事项","content":"**服务商 ID 不能叫 `openai`**：`openai`、`ollama`、`lmstudio` 是保留名称。"},"80":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-38","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#注意事项","content":"**改完要重启**：退出当前 Codex 会话后重新运行 `codex`；IDE 插件需要重启 IDE。"},"81":{"id":"/docs/agents/codex-39","page_id":"/docs/agents/codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/agents/codex#注意事项","content":"**图形化配置**：不想手动改文件，可以用 CC Switch 管理 Codex 配置，或在控制台 **API 密钥** 页面点击 **使用密钥** 复制自动生成的配置。"},"82":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","type":"page","content":"创建 API Key","breadcrumbs":["Docs","准备工作"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/api-key"},"83":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-0","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key","content":"注册账号、创建密钥、选择分组"},"84":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-1","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/api-key#创建步骤","content":"创建步骤"},"85":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-2","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/api-key#注册并登录","content":"注册并登录"},"86":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-3","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/api-key#新建密钥","content":"新建密钥"},"87":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-4","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/api-key#选择分组","content":"选择分组"},"88":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-5","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/api-key#复制密钥","content":"复制密钥"},"89":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-6","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/api-key#控制台自带的配置生成器","content":"控制台自带的配置生成器"},"90":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-7","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/api-key#可选的密钥限制","content":"可选的密钥限制"},"91":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-8","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/api-key#查询余额","content":"查询余额"},"92":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-9","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key","content":"API Key 是客户端调用网关时的身份凭证：系统靠它识别是谁在使用、还剩多少额度、该走哪个分组。"},"93":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-10","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#注册并登录","content":"打开 api.muteki.site 注册账号。注册需要邮箱验证码，且只支持部分邮箱后缀，以注册页的提示为准。"},"94":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-11","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#新建密钥","content":"在左侧栏进入 **API 密钥** 页面，点击创建。名称建议按用途命名，例如 `claude-code`、`codex-laptop`、`kelivo-phone`，以后哪个密钥泄露了可以单独删掉。"},"95":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-12","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#选择分组","content":"**一个密钥只属于一个分组**，分组决定了这个密钥能用哪些模型、按什么倍率计费："},"96":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-13","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#选择分组","content":"| 分组         | 可用模型                | 适合的客户端                   |\n| ---------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **OpenAI** | GPT 系列（如 `gpt-5.6`） | Codex、各类 OpenAI 兼容聊天 App |","table":"table-0"},"97":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-14","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#选择分组","content":"| 分组                | 可用模型               | 适合的客户端           |\n| ----------------- | ------------------ | ---------------- |\n| **OpenAI (Fast)** | 同上，走 Fast 模式（计费更高） | 对速度要求高的 Codex 用户 |","table":"table-0"},"98":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-15","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#选择分组","content":"| 分组            | 可用模型                             | 适合的客户端                   |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **Anthropic** | Claude 系列（如 `claude-sonnet-5-5`） | Claude Code、Claude 兼容客户端 |","table":"table-0"},"99":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-16","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#选择分组","content":"各分组当前的模型列表和倍率以控制台 **模型广场** 为准。没有分配分组的密钥无法调用任何接口。"},"100":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-17","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#复制密钥","content":"创建完成后复制完整密钥（`sk-` 开头）。下一步配置客户端时会用到。"},"101":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-18","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#复制密钥","content":"任何拿到密钥的人都能消耗你的余额。怀疑泄露时，立即在 **API 密钥** 页面删除旧密钥并新建一个。"},"102":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-19","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#控制台自带的配置生成器","content":"在 **API 密钥** 页面点击密钥旁的 **使用密钥**，会按分组生成 Claude Code、Codex CLI、OpenCode 等客户端的配置片段，已经填好了你的密钥和正确的 Base URL，可以直接复制。"},"103":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-20","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#控制台自带的配置生成器","content":"如果你装了 CC Switch，还可以用页面上的 **导入到 CC Switch** 按钮一键导入。"},"104":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-21","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#可选的密钥限制","content":"创建或编辑密钥时可以设置："},"105":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-22","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#可选的密钥限制","content":"**额度上限**：这个密钥最多能消耗多少，用完后返回 429。"},"106":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-23","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#可选的密钥限制","content":"**过期时间**：到期后密钥自动失效。"},"107":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-24","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#可选的密钥限制","content":"**IP 白名单 / 黑名单**：只允许指定 IP 使用。"},"108":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-25","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#可选的密钥限制","content":"给临时设备或分享给他人测试的密钥，建议都设上额度和过期时间。"},"109":{"id":"/docs/basics/api-key-26","page_id":"/docs/basics/api-key","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/api-key#查询余额","content":"除了在控制台查看，也可以直接用密钥查询（密钥过期或额度用完时也能查）："},"110":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","type":"page","content":"接口地址与协议","breadcrumbs":["Docs","准备工作"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/endpoints"},"111":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-0","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints","content":"Base URL 带不带 /v1、支持哪些协议、怎么测试连通性"},"112":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-1","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#base-url-速查","content":"Base URL 速查"},"113":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-2","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#接口列表","content":"接口列表"},"114":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-3","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#跨协议调用","content":"跨协议调用"},"115":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-4","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#认证方式","content":"认证方式"},"116":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-5","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#备用节点","content":"备用节点"},"117":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-6","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#测试连通性","content":"测试连通性"},"118":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-7","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#base-url-速查","content":"网关同时兼容 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 两套协议。**Base URL 填什么取决于客户端用哪套协议**，而不是用哪家的模型："},"119":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-8","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#base-url-速查","content":"| 客户端协议              | Base URL                  | 典型客户端                    |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| Anthropic Messages | `https://api.muteki.site` | Claude Code、Claude 兼容客户端 |","table":"table-0"},"120":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-9","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#base-url-速查","content":"| 客户端协议            | Base URL                     | 典型客户端 |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------- | ----- |\n| OpenAI Responses | `https://api.muteki.site/v1` | Codex |","table":"table-0"},"121":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-10","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#base-url-速查","content":"| 客户端协议                   | Base URL                     | 典型客户端                       |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| OpenAI Chat Completions | `https://api.muteki.site/v1` | Kelivo、RikkaHub 等绝大多数聊天 App |","table":"table-0"},"122":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-11","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#base-url-速查","content":"Anthropic 协议的客户端会自动在 Base URL 后面拼上 `/v1/messages`。如果你填了 `https://api.muteki.site/v1`，实际请求就变成 `/v1/v1/messages`，结果是 404。"},"123":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-12","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#base-url-速查","content":"有些客户端会自动在地址后面补 `/v1`，有些不会。具体以各客户端教程为准；不确定时，填完后用客户端的「检测 / 获取模型」按钮试一下。"},"124":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-13","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#接口列表","content":"| 接口                  | 协议                 | 说明              |\n| ------------------- | ------------------ | --------------- |\n| `POST /v1/messages` | Anthropic Messages | Claude Code 等使用 |","table":"table-1"},"125":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-14","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#接口列表","content":"| 接口                          | 协议                      | 说明         |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------- | ---------- |\n| `POST /v1/chat/completions` | OpenAI Chat Completions | 大多数聊天客户端使用 |","table":"table-1"},"126":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-15","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#接口列表","content":"| 接口                   | 协议               | 说明                    |\n| -------------------- | ---------------- | --------------------- |\n| `POST /v1/responses` | OpenAI Responses | Codex 使用，支持 WebSocket |","table":"table-1"},"127":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-16","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#接口列表","content":"| 接口               | 协议  | 说明          |\n| ---------------- | --- | ----------- |\n| `GET /v1/models` | —   | 当前密钥可用的模型列表 |","table":"table-1"},"128":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-17","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#接口列表","content":"| 接口              | 协议  | 说明      |\n| --------------- | --- | ------- |\n| `GET /v1/usage` | —   | 查询余额与用量 |","table":"table-1"},"129":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-18","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#跨协议调用","content":"网关会在协议之间自动转换，但有前提："},"130":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-19","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#跨协议调用","content":"**Anthropic 分组**：除了原生的 `/v1/messages`，也可以通过 `/v1/chat/completions` 和 `/v1/responses` 调用 Claude 模型，所以 Claude 模型也能在 Codex 和聊天 App 里使用。如果分组被设置为「仅限 Claude Code」，则只能通过 Claude Code 调用。"},"131":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-20","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#跨协议调用","content":"**OpenAI 分组**：原生支持 `/v1/responses` 和 `/v1/chat/completions`。能否通过 `/v1/messages` 在 Claude Code 里使用 GPT 模型，取决于站点是否为该分组开启了 Messages 转发。判断方法：控制台 **使用密钥** 弹窗里出现了 Claude Code 选项卡，就说明已开启。"},"132":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-21","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#认证方式","content":"以下三种请求头任选其一，客户端一般会自动处理："},"133":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-22","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#认证方式","content":"不支持把密钥放在 URL 参数里（`?key=sk-...`），会返回 400 `api_key_in_query_deprecated`。"},"134":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-23","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#备用节点","content":"除主站 `https://api.muteki.site` 外，还有以下接入节点，地址规则与主站完全相同（把域名换掉即可）："},"135":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-24","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#备用节点","content":"| 节点  | 地址                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------- |\n| 美国  | `https://api-us.muteki.site` |","table":"table-2"},"136":{"id":"/docs/basics/endpoints-25","page_id":"/docs/basics/endpoints","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/basics/endpoints#备用节点","content":"| 节点   | 地址                            |\n| ---- | -------------------