/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop#修改-codex-配置文件","content":"目录或文件不存在就新建。Windows 可以按 `Win + R`，输入 `%USERPROFILE%\\.codex` 打开目录。把下面三行加到文件**最开头**："},"254":{"id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop-14","page_id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop#修改-codex-配置文件","content":"已经按 Codex 教程配置过 CLI 的，可以跳过这一步。"},"255":{"id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop-15","page_id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop#完全退出并重新打开客户端","content":"配置文件只在启动时读取。关闭窗口不等于退出，请从托盘 / 程序坞右键彻底退出后再打开。"},"256":{"id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop-16","page_id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop#用-api-key-登录-codex","content":"进入 Codex，在登录界面选择 **Sign in another way**（其他登录方式），选择用 API Key 登录，粘贴你的 `sk-` 密钥后点击 **Continue**。"},"257":{"id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop-17","page_id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop#注意事项","content":"用 API Key 登录时，部分依赖 ChatGPT 账号的 Codex 功能可能不可用。"},"258":{"id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop-18","page_id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop#注意事项","content":"想换模型，修改 `config.toml` 中的 `model` 后重启客户端，模型名以模型广场中 OpenAI 分组的列表为准。"},"259":{"id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop-19","page_id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop#注意事项","content":"不要用「方式二：自定义服务商」中的环境变量方式配置桌面客户端：从桌面图标启动的程序可能读不到终端里设置的环境变量。"},"260":{"id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop-20","page_id":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/chatgpt-desktop#注意事项","content":"更多配置说明见 Codex。"},"261":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","type":"page","content":"Claude Desktop","breadcrumbs":["Docs","桌面应用"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop"},"262":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-0","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop",