d":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-11","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#安装-claude-desktop","content":"从 claude.com/download 下载并安装。打开后**不要登录，也不要注册** Anthropic 账号。"},"274":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-12","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#开启开发者模式","content":"在菜单栏选择 **Help → Troubleshooting → Enable Developer Mode**。"},"275":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-13","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#开启开发者模式","content":"Windows 上这些菜单在登录界面左上角的 **☰** 菜单里。"},"276":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-14","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#打开第三方推理配置","content":"选择 **Developer → Configure Third-Party Inference…**。"},"277":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-15","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#填写网关信息","content":"在 **Connection** 中填写："},"278":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-16","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#填写网关信息","content":"| 字段                 | 填写          |\n| ------------------ | ----------- |\n| Inference provider | **Gateway** |","table":"table-0"},"279":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-17","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#填写网关信息","content":"| 字段               | 填写                        |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------- |\n| Gateway base URL | `https://api.muteki.site` |","table":"table-0"},"280":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-18","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#填写网关信息","content":"| 字段              | 填写        |\n| --------------- | --------- |\n| Gateway API key | `sk-你的密钥` |","table":"table-0"},"281":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-19","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#填写网关信息","content":"| 字段              | 填写                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------ |\n| Credential kind | **Static API key** |","table":"table-0"},"282":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-20","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#填写网关信息","content":"| 字段                  | 填写             |\n| ------------------- | -------------- |\n| Gateway auth scheme | **Bearer**（默认） |","table":"table-0"},"283":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-21","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#填写网关信息","content":"如果连接测试返回 404，把 Gateway base URL 改成 `https://api.muteki.site/v1` 再试一次。"},"284":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-22","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#保存并重启","content":"点击 **Apply Changes**，再点击 **Save & Restart**。重启后在登录界面选择第三方推理的入口，即可开始使用。"},"285":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-23","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#模型","content":"Claude Desktop 会自动从网关读取可用的 Claude 模型，一般不需要手动配置。如果模型列表为空，确认密钥属于 Anthropic 分组。"},"286":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-24","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#注意事项","content":"**Code 标签页不读取 Claude Code 的配置**：Claude Desktop 里的 Code 功能只使用上面的第三方推理配置，不读取 `~/.claude/settings.json` 和 `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`。终端版 Claude Code 的配置见 Claude Code。"},"287":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-25","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#注意事项","content":"**部分功能不可用**：第三方推理模式下没有语音模式和 Remote Control，对话记录只保存在本机。"},"288":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-26","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#注意事项","content":"**配置保存位置**：应用内窗口写入的配置保存在下面的目录，建议始终通过应用内窗口修改，不要手动编辑："},"289":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-27","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#注意事项","content":"| 系统      | 配置目录                                      | 日志                                       |\n| ------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Windows | `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Claude-3p\\configLibrary\\` | `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Claude-3p\\Logs\\main.log` |","table":"table-1"},"290":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-28","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#注意事项","content":"| 系统    | 配置目录                                                     | 日志                                  |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| macOS | `~/Library/Application Support/Claude-3p/configLibrary/` | `~/Library/Logs/Claude-3p/main.log` |","table":"table-1"},"291":{"id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop-29","page_id":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/desktop/claude-desktop#注意事项","content":"连接失败时可以查看日志里的具体报错，再对照 常见问题。"},"292":{"id":"/docs/faq","page_id":"/docs/faq","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/faq"},"293":{"id":"/docs/faq-0","page_id":"/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/faq","content":"常见报错的原因和解决办法"},"294":{"id":"/docs/faq-1","page_id":"/docs/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/faq#错误码速查","content":"错误码速查"},"295":{"id":"/docs/faq-2","page_id":"/docs/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/faq#其他问题","content":"其他问题"},"296":{"id":"/docs/faq-3","page_id":"/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/faq#错误码速查","content":"| 状态码 | 错误信息（关键字）          | 原因       | 解决办法                     |\n| --- | ------------------ | -------- | ------------------------ |\n| 401 | `API_KEY_REQUIRED` | 请求里没有带密钥 | 检查客户端的 API Key 是否填写、是否保存 |","table":"table-0"},"297":{"id":"/docs/faq-4","page_id":"/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/faq#错误码速查","content":"| 状态码 | 错误信息（关键字） | 原因               | 解决办法         |\n| --- | --------- | ---------------- | ------------ |\n| 401 | 密钥无效      | 密钥填错、多了空格，或密钥已删除 | 重新从控制台复制完整密钥 |","table":"table-0"},"298":{"id":"/docs/faq-5","page_id":"/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/faq#错误码速查","content":"| 状态码 | 错误信息（关键字）                     | 原因             | 解决办法              |\n| --- | ----------------------------- | -------------- | ----------------- |\n| 400 | `api_key_in_query_deprecated` | 把密钥放在了 URL 参数里 | 改为在 API Key 字段里填写 |","table":"table-0"},"299":{"id":"/docs/faq-6","page_id":"/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/faq#错误码速查","content":"| 状态码 | 错误信息（关键字）              | 原因     | 解决办法   |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ------ | ------ |\n| 403 | `INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE` | 账户余额不足 | 在控制台充值 |","table":"table-0"},"300":{"id":"/docs/faq-7","page_id":"/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/faq#错误码速查","content":"| 状态码 | 错误信息（关键字）         | 原因    | 解决办法        |\n| --- | ----------------- | ----- | ----------- |\n| 403 | `API_KEY_EXPIRED` | 密钥已过期 | 修改过期时间或新建密钥 |","table":"table-0"},"301":{"id":"/docs/faq-8","page_id":"/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/faq#错误码速查","content":"| 状态码 | 错误信息（关键字）                   | 原因     | 解决办法        |\n| --- | --------------------------- | ------ | ----------- |\n| 403 | `not assigned to any group` | 密钥没有分组 | 编辑密钥，选择一个分组 |","table":"table-0"},"302":{"id":"/docs/faq-9","page_id":"/docs/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/faq#错误码速查","content":"| 状态码 | 错误信息（关键字）                              | 原因                          | 解决办法                                 |\n| --- | -------------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 403 | `does not allow /v1/messages 